  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Issue: for some reason, DWA-M 150 classifies this as an alphanumerical string instead of a boolean. A boolean would be the better choice: Yes: an einer Verbindung aufgetreten; No: nicht an einer Verbindung aufgetreten. Instead: M150 says if empty then no, if A then yes.This will have to be reflected in the OntoParser somehow."
  } ],
